  "title": "Mascarpone Stuffed French Toast with Peaches",
  "description": "Mascarpone stuffed French toast with peaches recipe stuffs thick bread with lemon zest and mascarpone, batter dips, fries, and tops with peach sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Escapechef"
  ],
